OL,3,GNEWSAD-day era floating roadway saved
OL,4,Aby preservation work
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of a historic floating World War
OL,7,FTwo roadway of the type used during the
OL,8,FD-Day landings has been saved from
OL,9,Ffurther deterioration and is set to go
OL,10,Fon display.
OL,12,FMulberry Harbours, as they were known,
OL,13,Fwere built in the UK and used overseas
OL,14,Fto help transfer Allied troops and
OL,15,Fequipment as they began the liberation
OL,16,Fof France.
