OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAD-day era floating roadway saved
OL,4,Aby preservation work
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssociated British Ports (ABP) used
OL,7,Fcranes to lift the flexible roadway
OL,8,Fsection of the Mulberry Harbour, known
OL,9,Fas a whale, from Town Quay in
OL,10,FSouthampton last year after it had
OL,11,Fspent decades partially submerged.
OL,13,FIt will later be placed at the Solent
OL,14,FGateway site in Marchwood, where it is
OL,15,Fbelieved to have been built, along with
OL,16,Finformation boards explaining its
OL,17,Fhistory.
